## Why This Is Asked

This question probes streaming PCA design under non-Gaussian features, missing data, and latency constraints, forcing trade-offs between online imputation, update cadence, and drift alerts.

## Key Concepts

- Streaming PCA, online imputation, drift detection
- Latency budgeting and micro-batching
